      "created_at": "2015-11-10T16:50:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So, looking at my timeline of things that need to be done and the priority they have, it's likely that Gen Con tournament videos will be up around the end of November. Putting them together is a pretty time-consuming process, because I actually have to watch them with my full attention to get pertinent information, and that's just going to have to wait until I'm fully caught up from convention season.</p><p>Sorry for the delay!</p>",
